# Response headers for Workers static assets (copied into dist/ by Vite).
# Caching is left alone on purpose: everything revalidates (see docs/architecture.md, Deploy),
# and the fonts under /assets/fonts/ keep their names when they are regenerated.
#
# CSP: everything is same-origin except the JSA portraits (img) and the Cloudflare Web Analytics
# beacon the edge injects (script from static.cloudflareinsights.com, beacons to /cdn-cgi/rum or
# cloudflareinsights.com). No inline script or style attribute is needed: React sets `style`
# through the CSSOM, and the JSON-LD block is data, not script. The 404 page's CSS is a file.
# .app is on the HSTS preload list as a whole TLD; the only hosts are the apex and www.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://www.sumo.or.jp; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://cloudflareinsights.com; manifest-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), browsing-topics=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
